      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. but i've heard people say that the idea of \"pure beauty\" is actually just a way for certain groups to keep power and stay in charge of what's considered \"good\" art. they say that by focusing on skill and beauty, we're just ignoring the systemic issues that made those standards in the first place. don't you think that critique has some merit?",
